> How do I get my gold off of a co-aligned, friendly priest in a manner
> that will allow me to remain on good enough terms with him so that I
> can give the gold back to purchase protection?

Two main approaches -

1) Some types of monsters can steal.  Use those types by
polymorph+polymorph-control rings or the actual monsters
plus conflict.

2) Use a pet or yourself to kill this priest and use the money
at the next one.  You have already lost your protection so
that bit isn't an issue.  There's also loss of telepathy and so
on if you do it yourself.

If taking approach 2 it's nice to know that another priest
exists in the game.  They aren't guaranteed until the VofD.



